  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label halloween12:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio1.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A girl stands alone, pressed up against a wall and dressed in significantly less clothing than she’s accustomed to.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Clothing that was meant to impress not only the man she adores but those around her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not in a cocky way, but in a way that says “I’m comfortable in my own skin.”",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "As comfortable as one can be, that is.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Cold air finds its way out of brand new, industrial air conditioners that line the tops of walls in an otherwise ancient building.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That air reaches her legs and causes her to shiver.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She gets goosebumps.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She’s been extremely susceptible to those since she was a little girl.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her mother was the same way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her sister, while less susceptible to them, was cursed with a slew of other issues.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The one pressed up against the wall wishes it were possible to trade places.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Getting goosebumps always makes her think of that.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But of course, that isn’t something worth telling anyone.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not important at all.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Nothing’s important, is it?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio2.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A second girl shows up.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her legs are cold as well.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But instead of letting her mind dwell on the depressing implication of goosebumps, she gets caught in thoughts of how fishnet stockings look best on girls with tanned skin.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s a thought much less personal than the girl on our right has, but it is a thought nonetheless.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That thought eventually transitions to how that girl must look underneath her costume, and the girl on our left attempts to break free from yet another sad delusion in the only way she knows how.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio3.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you know, um...Pac-man was originally called Puck-man but...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": They, umm...wound up changing the name because they realized it would be...too easy to vandalize...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Isn’t that from a movie?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hi.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio4.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you come over here because I looked lonely?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Whaaaaat? Noooo. Of course nooooot.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just happened to be in the area and...thought I’d drop by to say...you look really pretty tonight.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio5.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my God, so do you. I’ve been staring at your thighs all night, I’m not even going to lie.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s, umm...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want to touch them?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio6.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hm? What was that last part? I couldn’t really hear you.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What? Huh? There was no last part. The conversation ended after you complimented my thighs.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I didn’t even respond.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio7.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Rin...relax. You don’t need to act so weird around me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m glad you finally came to talk to me. I’ve been wondering when you were going to all night.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You didn’t...notice me staring at you or anything, did you? Because I totally wasn’t.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You totally were. We kept making eye contact for like, a split second before you'd turn away.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That doesn’t sound like a thing I would do at all.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio8.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside...are you having fun tonight?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I am, yeah...I kind of love Halloween.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, I kinda figured as much with all the skulls you wear and stuff.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t really...seem to be having a good time, though.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Could Yumi not make it?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You could have come...sat with us if you wanted.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just been Futaba and me for the most part.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly pops in to say hi every few minutes but then just awkwardly walks away a few seconds later.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heh~ Thanks for the offer. I’ll keep that in mind for the rest of the night.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yumi’s actually on the way, though, so I think that might make things a little awkward for Futaba. Poor girl.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio9.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, you wouldn’t happen to know...why Yumi is always that mean to her, would you?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I tried asking her on the beach and it didn’t really go well.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really wish I did.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Literally the only thing I can think of is that Futaba doesn’t really stand up for herself.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But that alone isn’t good enough reason to constantly bully somebody.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not like, there is a good reason to do that or anything. I just don’t really understand Yumi sometimes.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio10.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did you know it’s her birthday tonight?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yumi was...born on Halloween? That's so cool.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That she was. Such a waste that she’s never even dressed up for it.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So she’s coming to the party in her normal clothes? Like Sensei?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio11.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pretty sure, yeah.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We better be careful or the two of them might bond over their shared interest in always being buzzkills.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, right. Those two? They have just about as much of a chance as Maya and...literally anyone.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ve never really talked to Maya before. Is she really that unapproachable?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s not unapproachable, she’s just...Maya.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s hard to explain.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio12.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "A third girl shows up at the party, several hours late, and takes a spot between the two star-crossed lovers.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She has no costume, nor intent to don one, but is instead dressed in clothes that her mother used to wear before walking out on her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But even if the girl in the center can’t seem to get over that small yet significant part of her life, she still needs clothes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Because she, too, gets goosebumps easily.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Finally! I was wondering when the Hell you were going to show up.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Also, where are your manners? You totally just stepped between Rin and me while we were in the middle of a conversation.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m cool with you blowing me off but at least say hi to her or something.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio13.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...Hey.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look nice.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio14.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": U-Umm! Thanks...",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio15",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio15.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio15"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look like a slut.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio16.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mm...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Aren’t best friends supposed to like, you know, compliment each other instead of making them feel like trash?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are they?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio17.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hah...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is Chinami asleep?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did she remember your birthday at least?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She remembered that you told her to remember it.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And I see that she didn’t remember to not tell you I told her that.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nope.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s whatever, though. It’s just a day and she’s just a kid.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio18.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Happy birthday, Yumi.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry for getting all pissy with you on the beach.",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks. And it’s whatever. I deserved it. I was a bitch that day.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, I’m a bitch most days, so it’s cool.",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How old are you now, if you don’t mind me asking?",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m-",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene halloweentrio19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/halloweentrio19.webp",
      "alt": "halloweentrio19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, before you answer that question, I was wondering if you saw Sensei on the way in.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He’s been gone for a while now and I thought he might be out there.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If you’re worried about where he is, why don’t you just go look for him?",
      "spk": "Yumi",
      "spkColor": "#FF4949",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He’s probably fist deep inside of one of the other girls right now.",
